WEBVTT

00:00.050 --> 00:03.390
An agent can do the work. But can it show you what happened?

00:03.390 --> 00:09.250
Action gives agents a real Chrome and a native macOS runtime to observe, resolve, act, and record.

00:09.250 --> 00:14.250
Every run leaves evidence: the capture, the trace, the snapshot, the accessibility tree, and the manifest.

00:14.250 --> 00:18.610
One run. Every artifact. Ready to review, replay, and share.

00:18.610 --> 00:20.500
Action. Record the work.
